"more general context."
msgstr ""
"Hizi hufafanua muktadha wa kuwezesha usanidi huu. Ikiwa hakuna thamani "
"zilizowekwa, basi usanidi hutumika kimataifa. Ikiwa thamani moja imewekwa, "
"basi usanidi hutumika kwa kozi zote ndani ya muktadha huo. Kwa kiwango cha "
"juu, thamani moja tu inaweza kuwekwa kwa wakati mmoja.{br}Ikiwa miktadha "
"mingi inatumika kwa kozi (kwa mfano, ikiwa usanidi umebainishwa kwa kozi "
"yenyewe, na kwa org ambayo kozi iko ndani yake, basi muktadha mahususi zaidi"
" hutangulia muktadha wa jumla zaidi."

#: openedx/core/djangoapps/config_model_utils/admin.py:53
msgid ""
"If any of these values are left empty or \"Unknown\", then their value at "
"runtime will be retrieved from the next most specific context that applies. "
"For example, if \"Enabled\" is left as \"Unknown\" in the course context, "
"then that course will be Enabled only if the org that it is in is Enabled."
msgstr ""
"Ikiwa mojawapo ya thamani hizi itaachwa tupu au \"Unknown\", basi thamani "
"yake wakati wa utekelezaji itachukuliwa kutoka muktadha unaofuata ulio "
"mahususi zaidi unaotumika. Kwa mfano, ikiwa \"Enabled\" itaachwa kama "
"\"Unknown\" katika muktadha wa kozi, basi kozi hiyo itawezeshwa tu ikiwa org"
" ambayo iko ndani yake imewezeshwa."

