msgstr "Ufunguo wa API wa Matlab"

#: xmodule/capa_block.py:345
msgid ""
"Enter the API key provided by MathWorks for accessing the MATLAB Hosted "
"Service. This key is granted for exclusive use by this course for the "
"specified duration. Please do not share the API key with other courses and "
"notify MathWorks immediately if you believe the key is exposed or "
"compromised. To obtain a key for your course, or to report an issue, please "
"contact moocsupport@mathworks.com"
msgstr ""
"Weka ufunguo wa API uliotolewa na MathWorks kwa ajili ya kufikia Huduma "
"Inayohifadhiwa ya MATLAB. Ufunguo huu umetolewa kwa matumizi ya kipekee ya "
"kozi hii kwa muda uliobainishwa. Tafadhali usishiriki ufunguo wa API na kozi"
" nyingine na mjulishe MathWorks mara moja ikiwa unaamini ufunguo "
"umefichuliwa au umeathiriwa. Ili kupata ufunguo kwa kozi yako, au kuripoti "
"tatizo, tafadhali wasiliana na moocsupport@mathworks.com"

#: xmodule/capa_block.py:354
msgid ""
"Indicates if the problem was edited using the Markdown editor in the "
