msgstr ""
"Weka URL ya utafiti wa mwisho wa kozi. Ikiwa kozi yako haina utafiti, weka "
"null."

#: xmodule/course_block.py:430
msgid "Discussion Blackout Dates"
msgstr "Tarehe za Kuzuia Majadiliano"

#: xmodule/course_block.py:432
msgid ""
"Enter pairs of dates between which students cannot post to discussion "
"forums. Inside the provided brackets, enter an additional set of square "
"brackets surrounding each pair of dates you add. Format each pair of dates "
"as [\"YYYY-MM-DD\", \"YYYY-MM-DD\"]. To specify times as well as dates, "
"format each pair as [\"YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM\", \"YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM\"]. Be sure to"
" include the \"T\" between the date and time. For example, an entry defining"
" two blackout periods looks like this, including the outer pair of square "
"brackets: [[\"2015-09-15\", \"2015-09-21\"], [\"2015-10-01\", "
"\"2015-10-08\"]] "
msgstr ""
"Weka jozi za tarehe kati ya ambazo wanafunzi hawawezi kuchapisha kwenye "
"vikao vya majadiliano. Ndani ya mabano yaliyotolewa, weka seti ya ziada ya "
"mabano ya mraba kuzunguka kila jozi ya tarehe unayoongeza. Weka muundo wa "
"kila jozi ya tarehe kama [\"YYYY-MM-DD\", \"YYYY-MM-DD\"]. Ili kubainisha "
"nyakati pamoja na tarehe, weka muundo wa kila jozi kama [\"YYYY-MM-"
"DDTHH:MM\", \"YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM\"]. Hakikisha unajumuisha \"T\" kati ya "
"tarehe na muda. Kwa mfano, ingizo linalofafanua vipindi viwili vya kuzuia "
"linaonekana hivi, likijumuisha jozi ya nje ya mabano ya mraba: "
"[[\"2015-09-15\", \"2015-09-21\"], [\"2015-10-01\", \"2015-10-08\"]]"

#: xmodule/course_block.py:442
msgid "Discussion Topic Mapping"
msgstr "Ulinganishaji wa Mada za Majadiliano"

#: xmodule/course_block.py:444
msgid ""
"Enter discussion categories in the following format: \"CategoryName\": "
"{\"id\": \"i4x-InstitutionName-CourseNumber-course-CourseRun\"}. For "
"example, one discussion category may be \"Lydian Mode\": {\"id\": "
"\"i4x-UniversityX-MUS101-course-2015_T1\"}. The \"id\" value for each "
"category must be unique. In \"id\" values, the only special characters that "
"are supported are underscore, hyphen, and period. You can also specify a "
"category as the default for new posts in the Discussion page by setting its "
"\"default\" attribute to true. For example, \"Lydian Mode\": {\"id\": "
"\"i4x-UniversityX-MUS101-course-2015_T1\", \"default\": true}."
msgstr ""
"Weka kategoria za majadiliano katika muundo ufuatao: \"CategoryName\": "
"{\"id\": \"i4x-InstitutionName-CourseNumber-course-CourseRun\"}. Kwa mfano, "
"kategoria moja ya majadiliano inaweza kuwa \"Lydian Mode\": {\"id\": "
"\"i4x-UniversityX-MUS101-course-2015_T1\"}. Thamani ya \"id\" kwa kila "
"kategoria lazima iwe ya kipekee. Katika thamani za \"id\", herufi maalum "
"pekee zinazotumika ni underscore, hyphen, na period. Unaweza pia kubainisha "
"kategoria kama chaguo-msingi kwa machapisho mapya kwenye ukurasa wa "
"Majadiliano kwa kuweka sifa yake ya \"default\" kuwa true. Kwa mfano, "
"\"Lydian Mode\": {\"id\": \"i4x-UniversityX-MUS101-course-2015_T1\", "
"\"default\": true}."

#: xmodule/course_block.py:456
msgid "Discussions Plugin Settings"
msgstr "Mipangilio ya Programu-jalizi za Majadiliano"

#: xmodule/course_block.py:458
msgid "Settings for discussions plugins."
msgstr "Mipangilio ya programu-jalizi za majadiliano."

#: xmodule/course_block.py:466
msgid "Course Announcement Date"
msgstr "Tarehe ya Tangazo la Kozi"

#: xmodule/course_block.py:467
msgid "Enter the date to announce your course."
msgstr "Weka tarehe ya kutangaza kozi yako."

#: xmodule/course_block.py:471
msgid "Cohort Configuration"
msgstr "Usanidi wa Cohort"

#: xmodule/course_block.py:473
msgid ""
"Enter policy keys and values to enable the cohort feature, define automated "
"student assignment to groups, or identify any course-wide discussion topics "
"as private to cohort members."
msgstr ""
"Weka funguo na thamani za sera ili kuwezesha kipengele cha cohort, kufafanua"
" upangaji wa kiotomatiki wa wanafunzi kwenye vikundi, au kutambua mada "
"zozote za majadiliano za kozi nzima kama za faragha kwa wanachama wa cohort."

#: xmodule/course_block.py:479
msgid "Course Is New"
msgstr "Kozi ni Mpya"

#: xmodule/course_block.py:481
msgid ""
"Enter true or false. If true, the course appears in the list of new courses,"
" and a New! badge temporarily appears next to the course image."
msgstr ""
"Weka true au false. Ikiwa true, kozi inaonekana kwenye orodha ya kozi mpya, "
"na beji ya New! inaonekana kwa muda karibu na picha ya kozi."

#: xmodule/course_block.py:487
msgid "Mobile Course Available"
msgstr "Kozi ya Simu Inapatikana"

#: xmodule/course_block.py:488
msgid ""
"Enter true or false. If true, the course will be available to mobile "
"devices."
msgstr ""
"Weka true au false. Ikiwa true, kozi itapatikana kwa vifaa vya mkononi."

#: xmodule/course_block.py:493
msgid "Video Upload Credentials"
msgstr "Vitambulisho vya Kupakia Video"

#: xmodule/course_block.py:495
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Enter the unique identifier for your course's video files provided by "
"{platform_name}."
msgstr ""
"Weka kitambulisho cha kipekee cha faili za video za kozi yako kilichotolewa "
"na {platform_name}."

#: xmodule/course_block.py:500
msgid "Course Not Graded"
msgstr "Kozi Haitapimwa"

#: xmodule/course_block.py:501
msgid "Enter true or false. If true, the course will not be graded."
msgstr "Weka true au false. Ikiwa true, kozi haitapimwa."

#: xmodule/course_block.py:506
msgid "Disable Progress Graph"
msgstr "Zima Grafu ya Maendeleo"

#: xmodule/course_block.py:507
msgid "Enter true or false. If true, students cannot view the progress graph."
msgstr ""
"Weka true au false. Ikiwa true, wanafunzi hawawezi kuona grafu ya maendeleo."

#: xmodule/course_block.py:512
msgid "PDF Textbooks"
msgstr "Vitabu vya Kiada vya PDF"

#: xmodule/course_block.py:513
msgid "List of dictionaries containing pdf_textbook configuration"
msgstr "Orodha ya kamusi (dictionaries) zenye usanidi wa pdf_textbook"

#: xmodule/course_block.py:516
msgid "HTML Textbooks"
msgstr "Vitabu vya Kiada vya HTML"

#: xmodule/course_block.py:518
msgid ""
"For HTML textbooks that appear as separate tabs in the course, enter the "
"name of the tab (usually the title of the book) as well as the URLs and "
"titles of each chapter in the book."
msgstr ""
"Kwa vitabu vya kiada vya HTML vinavyoonekana kama vichupo tofauti kwenye "
"kozi, weka jina la kichupo (kwa kawaida kichwa cha kitabu) pamoja na URL na "
"vichwa vya kila sura katika kitabu."

#: xmodule/course_block.py:524
msgid "Remote Gradebook"
msgstr "Kitabu cha Alama cha Mbali"

#: xmodule/course_block.py:526
msgid ""
"Enter the remote gradebook mapping. Only use this setting when "
"REMOTE_GRADEBOOK_URL has been specified."
msgstr ""
"Weka ulinganishaji wa kitabu cha alama cha mbali. Tumia mpangilio huu tu "
"wakati REMOTE_GRADEBOOK_URL imebainishwa."

#: xmodule/course_block.py:535
msgid "Enable CCX"
msgstr "Wezesha CCX"

#: xmodule/course_block.py:540
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Allow course instructors to assign CCX Coach roles, and allow coaches to "
"manage Custom Courses on {platform_name}. When false, Custom Courses cannot "
"be created, but existing Custom Courses will be preserved."
msgstr ""
"Ruhusu wakufunzi wa kozi kugawa majukumu ya CCX Coach, na ruhusu makocha "
"kusimamia Kozi Maalum kwenye {platform_name}. Ikiwa false, Kozi Maalum "
"haziwezi kuundwa, lakini Kozi Maalum zilizopo zitahifadhiwa."

#: xmodule/course_block.py:549
msgid "CCX Connector URL"
msgstr "URL ya Kiunganishi cha CCX"

#: xmodule/course_block.py:552
msgid ""
"URL for CCX Connector application for managing creation of CCXs. (optional)."
" Ignored unless 'Enable CCX' is set to 'true'."
msgstr ""
"URL ya programu ya CCX Connector kwa kusimamia uundaji wa CCX. (hiari). "
"Hupuuzwa isipokuwa 'Enable CCX' imewekwa kuwa 'true'."

#: xmodule/course_block.py:558
msgid "Allow Anonymous Discussion Posts"
msgstr "Ruhusu Machapisho ya Majadiliano Yasiyo na Jina"

#: xmodule/course_block.py:559
msgid ""
"Enter true or false. If true, students can create discussion posts that are "
"anonymous to all users."
msgstr ""
"Weka true au false. Ikiwa true, wanafunzi wanaweza kuunda machapisho ya "
"majadiliano ambayo hayana jina kwa watumiaji wote."

#: xmodule/course_block.py:563
msgid "Allow Anonymous Discussion Posts to Peers"
msgstr "Ruhusu Machapisho ya Majadiliano Yasiyo na Jina kwa Wenza"

#: xmodule/course_block.py:565
msgid ""
"Enter true or false. If true, students can create discussion posts that are "
"anonymous to other students. This setting does not make posts anonymous to "
"course staff."
msgstr ""
"Weka true au false. Ikiwa true, wanafunzi wanaweza kuunda machapisho ya "
"majadiliano ambayo hayana jina kwa wanafunzi wengine. Mpangilio huu haufanyi"
" machapisho kuwa bila jina kwa wafanyakazi wa kozi."

#: xmodule/course_block.py:571 xmodule/library_root_xblock.py:36
msgid "Advanced Module List"
msgstr "Orodha ya Moduli za Juu"

#: xmodule/course_block.py:572
msgid "Enter the names of the advanced modules to use in your course."
msgstr "Weka majina ya moduli za juu za kutumia katika kozi yako."

#: xmodule/course_block.py:578
msgid ""
"True if timezones should be shown on dates in the course. Deprecated in "
"favor of due_date_display_format."
msgstr ""
"True ikiwa maeneo ya saa yanapaswa kuonyeshwa kwenye tarehe katika kozi. "
"Imeacha kutumika kwa niaba ya due_date_display_format."

#: xmodule/course_block.py:584
msgid "Due Date Display Format"
msgstr "Muundo wa Kuonyesha Tarehe ya Mwisho"

#: xmodule/course_block.py:586
msgid ""
"Enter the format for due dates. The default is Mon DD, YYYY. Enter "
"\"%m-%d-%Y\" for MM-DD-YYYY, \"%d-%m-%Y\" for DD-MM-YYYY, \"%Y-%m-%d\" for "
"YYYY-MM-DD, or \"%Y-%d-%m\" for YYYY-DD-MM."
msgstr ""
"Weka muundo wa tarehe za mwisho. Chaguo-msingi ni Mon DD, YYYY. Weka "
"\"%m-%d-%Y\" kwa MM-DD-YYYY, \"%d-%m-%Y\" kwa DD-MM-YYYY, \"%Y-%m-%d\" kwa "
"YYYY-MM-DD, au \"%Y-%d-%m\" kwa YYYY-DD-MM."

#: xmodule/course_block.py:592
msgid "External Login Domain"
msgstr "Domeni ya Kuingia ya Nje"

#: xmodule/course_block.py:593
msgid "Enter the external login method students can use for the course."
msgstr ""
"Weka mbinu ya kuingia ya nje ambayo wanafunzi wanaweza kutumia kwa kozi."

#: xmodule/course_block.py:597
msgid "Certificates Downloadable Before End"
msgstr "Vyeti Vinavyopakuliwa Kabla ya Mwisho"

#: xmodule/course_block.py:599
msgid ""
"Enter true or false. If true, students can download certificates before the "
"course ends, if they've met certificate requirements."
msgstr ""
"Weka true au false. Ikiwa true, wanafunzi wanaweza kupakua vyeti kabla ya "
"kozi kuisha, ikiwa wametimiza mahitaji ya cheti."

#: xmodule/course_block.py:608
msgid "Certificates Display Behavior"
msgstr "Tabia ya Kuonyesha Vyeti"

#: xmodule/course_block.py:610
msgid ""
"This field, together with certificate_available_date will determine when a "
"user can see their certificate for the course"
msgstr ""
"Sehemu hii, pamoja na certificate_available_date itaamua ni lini mtumiaji "
"anaweza kuona cheti chake cha kozi"

#: xmodule/course_block.py:617
msgid "Course About Page Image"
msgstr "Picha ya Ukurasa wa Kuhusu Kozi"

#: xmodule/course_block.py:619
msgid ""
"Edit the name of the course image file. You must upload this file on the "
"Files & Uploads page. You can also set the course image on the Settings & "
"Details page."
msgstr ""
"Hariri jina la faili ya picha ya kozi. Lazima upakie faili hii kwenye "
"ukurasa wa Files & Uploads. Unaweza pia kuweka picha ya kozi kwenye ukurasa "
"wa Settings & Details."

#: xmodule/course_block.py:628
msgid "Course Banner Image"
msgstr "Picha ya Bango la Kozi"

#: xmodule/course_block.py:630
msgid ""
"Edit the name of the banner image file. You can set the banner image on the "
"Settings & Details page."
msgstr ""
"Hariri jina la faili ya picha ya bango. Unaweza kuweka picha ya bango kwenye"
" ukurasa wa Settings & Details."

#: xmodule/course_block.py:638
msgid "Course Video Thumbnail Image"
msgstr "Picha Kijipicha ya Video ya Kozi"

#: xmodule/course_block.py:640
msgid ""
"Edit the name of the video thumbnail image file. You can set the video "
"thumbnail image on the Settings & Details page."
msgstr ""
"Hariri jina la faili ya picha kijipicha ya video. Unaweza kuweka picha "
"kijipicha ya video kwenye ukurasa wa Settings & Details."

#: xmodule/course_block.py:650
msgid ""
"Use this setting only when generating PDF certificates. Between quotation "
"marks, enter the short name of the type of certificate that students receive"
" when they complete the course. For instance, \"Certificate\"."
msgstr ""
"Tumia mpangilio huu tu wakati wa kutengeneza vyeti vya PDF. Kati ya alama za"
" kunukuu, weka jina fupi la aina ya cheti ambacho wanafunzi hupokea "
"wanapokamilisha kozi. Kwa mfano, \"Certificate\"."

#: xmodule/course_block.py:654
msgid "Certificate Name (Short)"
msgstr "Jina la Cheti (Fupi)"

#: xmodule/course_block.py:660
msgid ""
"Use this setting only when generating PDF certificates. Between quotation "
"marks, enter the long name of the type of certificate that students receive "
"when they complete the course. For instance, \"Certificate of Achievement\"."
msgstr ""
"Tumia mpangilio huu tu wakati wa kutengeneza vyeti vya PDF. Kati ya alama za"
" kunukuu, weka jina refu la aina ya cheti ambacho wanafunzi hupokea "
"wanapokamilisha kozi. Kwa mfano, \"Certificate of Achievement\"."

#: xmodule/course_block.py:664
msgid "Certificate Name (Long)"
msgstr "Jina la Cheti (Refu)"

#: xmodule/course_block.py:669
msgid "Certificate Web/HTML View Enabled"
msgstr "Mwonekano wa Cheti wa Wavuti/HTML Umewezeshwa"

#: xmodule/course_block.py:670
msgid "If true, certificate Web/HTML views are enabled for the course."
msgstr "Ikiwa true, mionekano ya cheti ya Wavuti/HTML imewezeshwa kwa kozi."

#: xmodule/course_block.py:677
msgid "Certificate Web/HTML View Overrides"
msgstr "Marekebisho ya Mwonekano wa Cheti wa Wavuti/HTML"

#: xmodule/course_block.py:679
msgid ""
"Enter course-specific overrides for the Web/HTML template parameters here "
"(JSON format)"
msgstr ""
"Weka marekebisho mahususi ya kozi kwa vigezo vya kiolezo cha Wavuti/HTML "
"hapa (muundo wa JSON)"

#: xmodule/course_block.py:686
msgid "Certificate Configuration"
msgstr "Usanidi wa Cheti"

#: xmodule/course_block.py:688
msgid "Enter course-specific configuration information here (JSON format)"
msgstr "Weka taarifa za usanidi mahususi wa kozi hapa (muundo wa JSON)"

#: xmodule/course_block.py:702
msgid "CSS Class for Course Reruns"
msgstr "Darasa la CSS kwa Uendeshaji Upya wa Kozi"

#: xmodule/course_block.py:703
msgid ""
"Allows courses to share the same css class across runs even if they have "
"different numbers."
msgstr ""
"Hurusu kozi kushiriki darasa lilelile la css katika uendeshaji tofauti hata "
"kama zina nambari tofauti."

#: xmodule/course_block.py:714
msgid "Discussion Forum External Link"
msgstr "Kiungo cha Nje cha Jukwaa la Majadiliano"

#: xmodule/course_block.py:715
msgid "Allows specification of an external link to replace discussion forums."
msgstr ""
"Hurusu kubainisha kiungo cha nje kuchukua nafasi ya majukwaa ya majadiliano."

#: xmodule/course_block.py:724
msgid "Hide Progress Tab"
msgstr "Ficha Kichupo cha Maendeleo"

#: xmodule/course_block.py:725
msgid "Allows hiding of the progress tab."
msgstr "Hurusu kuficha kichupo cha maendeleo."

#: xmodule/course_block.py:731
msgid "Course Organization Display String"
msgstr "Mfuatano wa Kuonyesha Shirika la Kozi"

#: xmodule/course_block.py:733
msgid ""
"Enter the course organization that you want to appear in the course. This "
"setting overrides the organization that you entered when you created the "
"course. To use the organization that you entered when you created the "
"course, enter null."
msgstr ""
"Weka shirika la kozi unalotaka lionekane kwenye kozi. Mpangilio huu "
"unabatilisha shirika uliloweka ulipounda kozi. Ili kutumia shirika uliloweka"
" ulipounda kozi, weka null."

#: xmodule/course_block.py:741
msgid "Course Number Display String"
msgstr "Mfuatano wa Kuonyesha Namba ya Kozi"

#: xmodule/course_block.py:743
msgid ""
"Enter the course number that you want to appear in the course. This setting "
"overrides the course number that you entered when you created the course. To"
" use the course number that you entered when you created the course, enter "
"null."
msgstr ""
"Weka namba ya kozi unayotaka ionekane kwenye kozi. Mpangilio huu "
"unabatilisha namba ya kozi uliloweka ulipounda kozi. Ili kutumia namba ya "
"kozi uliloweka ulipounda kozi, weka null."

#: xmodule/course_block.py:752
msgid "Course Maximum Student Enrollment"
msgstr "Uandikishaji wa Juu wa Wanafunzi wa Kozi"

#: xmodule/course_block.py:754
msgid ""
"Enter the maximum number of students that can enroll in the course. To allow"
" an unlimited number of students, enter null."
msgstr ""
"Weka idadi ya juu ya wanafunzi wanaoweza kujiandikisha kwenye kozi. Ili "
"kuruhusu idadi isiyo na kikomo ya wanafunzi, weka null."

#: xmodule/course_block.py:761
msgid "Allow Public Wiki Access"
msgstr "Ruhusu Ufikiaji wa Wiki ya Umma"

#: xmodule/course_block.py:763
msgid ""
"Enter true or false. If true, students can view the course wiki even if "
"they're not enrolled in the course."
msgstr ""
"Weka true au false. Ikiwa true, wanafunzi wanaweza kuona wiki ya kozi hata "
"kama hawajaandikishwa kwenye kozi."

#: xmodule/course_block.py:771
msgid "Invitation Only"
msgstr "Kwa Mwaliko Pekee"

#: xmodule/course_block.py:772
msgid "Whether to restrict enrollment to invitation by the course staff."
msgstr "Iwapo kuzuia uandikishaji kwa mwaliko kutoka kwa wafanyakazi wa kozi."

#: xmodule/course_block.py:778
msgid "Pre-Course Survey Name"
msgstr "Jina la Utafiti wa Kabla ya Kozi"

#: xmodule/course_block.py:779
msgid "Name of SurveyForm to display as a pre-course survey to the user."
msgstr ""
"Jina la SurveyForm la kuonyesha kama utafiti wa kabla ya kozi kwa mtumiaji."

#: xmodule/course_block.py:786
msgid "Pre-Course Survey Required"
msgstr "Utafiti wa Kabla ya Kozi Unahitajika"

#: xmodule/course_block.py:788
msgid ""
"Specify whether students must complete a survey before they can view your "
"course content. If you set this value to true, you must add a name for the "
"survey to the Course Survey Name setting above."
msgstr ""
"Bainisha kama wanafunzi lazima wakamilishe utafiti kabla ya kuona maudhui ya"
" kozi yako. Ukiweka thamani hii kuwa true, lazima uongeze jina la utafiti "
"kwenye mpangilio wa Course Survey Name hapo juu."

#: xmodule/course_block.py:797
msgid "Course Visibility In Catalog"
msgstr "Mwonekano wa Kozi Katika Katalogi"

#: xmodule/course_block.py:801
msgid ""
"Defines the access permissions for showing the course in the course catalog."
" This can be set to one of three values: 'both' (show in catalog and allow "
"access to about page), 'about' (only allow access to about page), 'none' (do"
" not show in catalog and do not allow access to an about page)."
msgstr ""
"Hufafanua ruhusa za ufikiaji za kuonyesha kozi katika katalogi ya kozi. Hii "
"inaweza kuwekwa kwa mojawapo ya thamani tatu: 'both' (onyesha kwenye "
"katalogi na ruhusu ufikiaji wa ukurasa wa kuhusu), 'about' (ruhusu ufikiaji "
"wa ukurasa wa kuhusu pekee), 'none' (usionyeshe kwenye katalogi na usiruhusu"
" ukurasa wa kuhusu)."

#: xmodule/course_block.py:815
msgid "Entrance Exam Enabled"
msgstr "Mtihani wa Kuingia Umewezeshwa"

#: xmodule/course_block.py:817
msgid ""
"Specify whether students must complete an entrance exam before they can view"
" your course content. Note, you must enable Entrance Exams for this course "
"setting to take effect."
msgstr ""
"Bainisha kama wanafunzi lazima wakamilishe mtihani wa kuingia kabla ya kuona"
" maudhui ya kozi yako. Kumbuka, lazima uwezeshe Entrance Exams ili mpangilio"
" huu wa kozi uanze kufanya kazi."

#: xmodule/course_block.py:828
msgid "Entrance Exam Minimum Score (%)"
msgstr "Alama ya Chini ya Mtihani wa Kuingia (%)"

#: xmodule/course_block.py:830
msgid ""
"Specify a minimum percentage score for an entrance exam before students can "
"view your course content. Note, you must enable Entrance Exams for this "
"course setting to take effect."
msgstr ""
"Bainisha asilimia ya chini ya alama kwa mtihani wa kuingia kabla ya "
"wanafunzi kuona maudhui ya kozi yako. Kumbuka, lazima uwezeshe Entrance "
"Exams ili mpangilio huu wa kozi uanze kufanya kazi."

#: xmodule/course_block.py:838
msgid "Entrance Exam ID"
msgstr "Kitambulisho cha Mtihani wa Kuingia"

#: xmodule/course_block.py:839
msgid "Content block identifier (location) of entrance exam."
msgstr "Kitambulisho (eneo) cha kizuizi cha maudhui cha mtihani wa kuingia."

#: xmodule/course_block.py:845
msgid "Social Media Sharing URL"
msgstr "URL ya Kushiriki Mitandao ya Kijamii"

#: xmodule/course_block.py:847
msgid ""
"If dashboard social sharing and custom course URLs are enabled, you can "
"provide a URL (such as the URL to a course About page) that social media "
"sites can link to. URLs must be fully qualified. For example: "
"http://www.edx.org/course/Introduction-to-MOOCs-ITM001"
msgstr ""
"Ikiwa kushiriki kijamii kwenye dashibodi na URL maalum za kozi zimewezeshwa,"
" unaweza kutoa URL (kama URL ya ukurasa wa Kuhusu kozi) ambayo tovuti za "
"mitandao ya kijamii zinaweza kuunganisha. URL lazima ziwe kamili. Kwa mfano:"
" http://www.edx.org/course/Introduction-to-MOOCs-ITM001"

#: xmodule/course_block.py:855
msgid "Course Language"
msgstr "Lugha ya Kozi"

#: xmodule/course_block.py:856
msgid "Specify the language of your course."
msgstr "Bainisha lugha ya kozi yako."

#: xmodule/course_block.py:862
msgid "Teams Configuration"
msgstr "Usanidi wa Timu"

#: xmodule/course_block.py:865
msgid ""
"Configure team sets, limit team sizes, and set visibility settings using "
"JSON. See <a target=\"&#95;blank\" "
"href=\"https://docs.openedx.org/en/latest/educators/references/advanced_features/teams_configuration_options.html>teams"
" configuration documentation</a> for help and examples."
msgstr ""
"Sanidi seti za timu, weka kikomo cha ukubwa wa timu, na weka mipangilio ya "
"mwonekano kwa kutumia JSON. Tazama <a target=\"&#95;blank\" "
"href=\"https://docs.openedx.org/en/latest/educators/references/advanced_features/teams_configuration_options.html>nyaraka"
" za usanidi wa timu</a> kwa msaada na mifano."

#: xmodule/course_block.py:874
msgid "Enable Proctored Exams"
msgstr "Wezesha Mitihani Inayosimamiwa"

#: xmodule/course_block.py:876
msgid ""
"Enter true or false. If this value is true, proctored exams are enabled in "
"your course. Note that enabling proctored exams will also enable timed "
"exams."
msgstr ""
"Weka true au false. Ikiwa thamani hii ni true, mitihani inayosimamiwa "
"imewezeshwa kwenye kozi yako. Kumbuka kuwa kuwezesha mitihani inayosimamiwa "
"pia kutawezesha mitihani yenye muda."

#: xmodule/course_block.py:885
msgid "Proctoring Provider"
msgstr "Mtoa Huduma wa Usimamizi wa Mtihani"

#: xmodule/course_block.py:887
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Enter the proctoring provider you want to use for this course run. Choose "
"from the following options: {available_providers}."
msgstr ""
"Weka mtoa huduma wa usimamizi wa mtihani unayetaka kutumia kwa uendeshaji "
"huu wa kozi. Chagua kutoka chaguo zifuatazo: {available_providers}."

#: xmodule/course_block.py:901
msgid "Proctoring Exam Escalation Contact"
msgstr "Mwasiliani wa Kuongeza Kipaumbele kwa Mtihani Unaosimamiwa"

#: xmodule/course_block.py:903
msgid ""
"Required if 'requires_escalation_email' is set in the proctoring "
"backend.Enter an email address to be contacted by the support team whenever "
"there are escalations (e.g. appeals, delayed reviews, etc.)."
msgstr ""
"Inahitajika ikiwa 'requires_escalation_email' imewekwa kwenye nyuma ya "
"usimamizi wa mtihani. Weka anwani ya barua pepe ya kuwasiliana na timu ya "
"usaidizi kila mara kunapokuwa na uongezaji kipaumbele (mf. rufaa, mapitio "
"yaliyochelewa, n.k.)."

#: xmodule/course_block.py:913
msgid "Allow Opting Out of Proctored Exams"
msgstr "Ruhusu Kuchagua Kutofanya Mitihani Inayosimamiwa"

#: xmodule/course_block.py:915
msgid ""
"Enter true or false. If this value is true, learners can choose to take "
"proctored exams without proctoring. If this value is false, all learners "
"must take the exam with proctoring. This setting only applies if proctored "
"exams are enabled for the course."
msgstr ""
"Weka true au false. Ikiwa thamani hii ni true, wanafunzi wanaweza kuchagua "
"kufanya mitihani inayosimamiwa bila usimamizi. Ikiwa thamani hii ni false, "
"wanafunzi wote lazima wafanye mtihani kwa usimamizi. Mpangilio huu unatumika"
" tu ikiwa mitihani inayosimamiwa imewezeshwa kwa kozi."

#: xmodule/course_block.py:925
msgid "Create Zendesk Tickets For Suspicious Proctored Exam Attempts"
msgstr ""
"Unda Tiketi za Zendesk kwa Majaribio ya Mtihani Unaosimamiwa Yanayotiliwa "
"Shaka"

#: xmodule/course_block.py:927
msgid ""
"Enter true or false. If this value is true, a Zendesk ticket will be created"
" for suspicious attempts."
msgstr ""
"Weka true au false. Ikiwa thamani hii ni true, tiketi ya Zendesk itaundwa "
"kwa majaribio yanayotiliwa shaka."

#: xmodule/course_block.py:935
msgid "Enable Timed Exams"
msgstr "Wezesha Mitihani Yenye Muda"

#: xmodule/course_block.py:937
msgid ""
"Enter true or false. If this value is true, timed exams are enabled in your "
"course. Regardless of this setting, timed exams are enabled if Enable "
"Proctored Exams is set to true."
msgstr ""
"Weka true au false. Ikiwa thamani hii ni true, mitihani yenye muda "
"imewezeshwa kwenye kozi yako. Bila kujali mpangilio huu, mitihani yenye muda"
" imewezeshwa ikiwa Enable Proctored Exams imewekwa kuwa true."

#: xmodule/course_block.py:946
msgid "Minimum Grade for Credit"
msgstr "Alama ya Chini kwa Mkopo"

#: xmodule/course_block.py:948
msgid ""
"The minimum grade that a learner must earn to receive credit in the course, "
"as a decimal between 0.0 and 1.0. For example, for 75%, enter 0.75."
msgstr ""
"Alama ya chini ambayo mwanafunzi lazima apate ili kupata mkopo katika kozi, "
"kama desimali kati ya 0.0 na 1.0. Kwa mfano, kwa 75%, weka 0.75."

#: xmodule/course_block.py:956 xmodule/modulestore/inheritance.py:232
msgid "Self Paced"
msgstr "Kwa Kasi Yako Mwenyewe"

#: xmodule/course_block.py:958 xmodule/modulestore/inheritance.py:234
msgid ""
"Set this to \"true\" to mark this course as self-paced. Self-paced courses "
"do not have due dates for assignments, and students can progress through the"
" course at any rate before the course ends."
msgstr ""
"Weka hii kuwa \"true\" ili kuashiria kozi hii kuwa ya kasi yako mwenyewe. "
"Kozi za kasi yako mwenyewe hazina tarehe za mwisho za kazi, na wanafunzi "
"wanaweza kusonga mbele kwenye kozi kwa kasi yoyote kabla ya kozi kuisha."

#: xmodule/course_block.py:967
msgid "Enable Subsection Prerequisites"
msgstr "Wezesha Masharti ya Awali ya Sehemu Ndogo"

#: xmodule/course_block.py:969
msgid ""
"Enter true or false. If this value is true, you can hide a subsection until "
"learners earn a minimum score in another, prerequisite subsection."
msgstr ""
"Weka true au false. Ikiwa thamani hii ni true, unaweza kuficha sehemu ndogo "
"hadi wanafunzi wapate alama ya chini katika sehemu ndogo nyingine ya sharti."

#: xmodule/course_block.py:978
msgid "Course Learning Information"
msgstr "Taarifa za Kujifunza za Kozi"

#: xmodule/course_block.py:979
msgid "Specify what student can learn from the course."
msgstr ""
"Bainisha kile ambacho mwanafunzi anaweza kujifunza kutoka kwenye kozi."

#: xmodule/course_block.py:985
msgid "Course Visibility For Unenrolled Learners"
msgstr "Mwonekano wa Kozi kwa Wanafunzi Wasioandikishwa"

#: xmodule/course_block.py:989
msgid ""
"Defines the access permissions for unenrolled learners. This can be set to "
"one of three values: 'private' (default visibility, only allowed for "
"enrolled students), 'public_outline' (allow access to course outline) and "
"'public' (allow access to both outline and course content)."
msgstr ""
"Hufafanua ruhusa za ufikiaji kwa wanafunzi wasioandikishwa. Hii inaweza "
"kuwekwa kwa mojawapo ya thamani tatu: 'private' (mwonekano chaguo-msingi, "
"unaruhusiwa kwa wanafunzi walioandikishwa pekee), 'public_outline' (ruhusu "
"ufikiaji wa muhtasari wa kozi) na 'public' (ruhusu ufikiaji wa muhtasari na "
"maudhui ya kozi)."

#: xmodule/course_block.py:1003
msgid "Video Sharing Options"
msgstr "Chaguo za Kushiriki Video"

#: xmodule/course_block.py:1005
msgid ""
"Specify the video sharing options for the course. This can be set to one of "
"three values: 'all-on', 'all-off' and 'per-video'. with 'per-video' as the "
"default."
msgstr ""
"Bainisha chaguo za kushiriki video kwa kozi. Hii inaweza kuwekwa kwa "
"mojawapo ya thamani tatu: 'all-on', 'all-off' na 'per-video'. ambapo 'per-"
"video' ndiyo chaguo-msingi."

#: xmodule/course_block.py:1019
msgid "Force Flexible Grading for Peer ORAs"
msgstr "Lazimisha Upimaji Unaojipinda kwa ORA za Wenza"

#: xmodule/course_block.py:1020
msgid ""
"Setting this flag will force on the flexible grading option for all peer-"
"graded ORAs in this course."
msgstr ""
"Kuweka bendera hii kutalazimisha chaguo la upimaji unaojipinda kwa ORA zote "
"zinazopimwa na wenza katika kozi hii."

#: xmodule/course_block.py:1040
msgid "Course Instructor"
msgstr "Mwalimu wa Kozi"

#: xmodule/course_block.py:1041
msgid "Enter the details for Course Instructor"
msgstr "Weka maelezo ya Mwalimu wa Kozi"

#: xmodule/course_block.py:1048
msgid "Add Unsupported Problems and Tools"
msgstr "Ongeza Matatizo na Zana Zisizotumika"

#: xmodule/course_block.py:1050
msgid ""
"Enter true or false. If true, you can add unsupported problems and tools to "
"your course in Studio. Unsupported problems and tools are not recommended "
"for use in courses due to non-compliance with one or more of the base "
"requirements, such as testing, accessibility, internationalization, and "
"documentation."
msgstr ""
"Weka true au false. Ikiwa true, unaweza kuongeza matatizo na zana "
"zisizotumika kwenye kozi yako katika Studio. Matatizo na zana zisizotumika "
"hazipendekezwi kutumika kwenye kozi kwa sababu ya kutokukidhi moja au zaidi "
"ya mahitaji ya msingi, kama vile upimaji, ufikivu, ujanibishaji wa lugha, na"
" nyaraka."

#: xmodule/course_block.py:1057
msgid "Highlights Enabled for Messaging"
msgstr "Vivutio Vimewezeshwa kwa Ujumbe"

#: xmodule/course_block.py:1059
msgid ""
"Enter true or false. If true, any highlights associated with content in the "
"course will be messaged to learners at their scheduled time."
msgstr ""
"Weka true au false. Ikiwa true, vivutio vyovyote vinavyohusishwa na maudhui "
"katika kozi vitatumwa kwa wanafunzi kwa wakati wao uliopangwa."

#: xmodule/course_block.py:1066
msgid "Course-wide Custom JS"
msgstr "JS Maalum ya Kozi Nzima"

#: xmodule/course_block.py:1067
msgid ""
"Enter Javascript resource URLs you want to be loaded globally throughout the"
" course pages."
msgstr ""
"Weka URL za rasilimali za Javascript unazotaka zipakiwe kimataifa katika "
"kurasa zote za kozi."

#: xmodule/course_block.py:1072
msgid "Course-wide Custom CSS"
msgstr "CSS Maalum ya Kozi Nzima"

#: xmodule/course_block.py:1073
msgid ""
"Enter CSS resource URLs you want to be loaded globally throughout the course"
" pages."
msgstr ""
"Weka URL za rasilimali za CSS unazotaka zipakiwe kimataifa katika kurasa "
"zote za kozi."

#: xmodule/course_block.py:1078
msgid "Other Course Settings"
msgstr "Mipangilio Mingine ya Kozi"

#: xmodule/course_block.py:1080
msgid ""
"Any additional information about the course that the platform needs or that "
"allows integration with external systems such as CRM software. Enter a "
"dictionary of values in JSON format, such as { \"my_custom_setting\": "
"\"value\", \"other_setting\": \"value\" }"
msgstr ""
"Taarifa yoyote ya ziada kuhusu kozi ambayo jukwaa linahitaji au inayoruhusu "
"ujumuishaji na mifumo ya nje kama programu za CRM. Weka kamusi ya thamani "
"katika muundo wa JSON, kama vile { \"my_custom_setting\": \"value\", "
"\"other_setting\": \"value\" }"

#: xmodule/course_block.py:1132
msgid "General"
msgstr "Jumla"

#: xmodule/discussion_block.py:56
msgid "Category"
msgstr "Kategoria"

#: xmodule/discussion_block.py:57
msgid "Week 1"
msgstr "Wiki ya 1"

#: xmodule/discussion_block.py:59
msgid ""
"A category name for the discussion. This name appears in the left pane of "
"the discussion forum for the course."
msgstr ""
"Jina la kategoria kwa mjadala. Jina hili linaonekana kwenye kidirisha cha "
"kushoto cha jukwaa la mijadala kwa kozi."

#: xmodule/discussion_block.py:65
msgid "Subcategory"
msgstr "Kategoria ndogo"

#: xmodule/discussion_block.py:68
msgid ""
"A subcategory name for the discussion. This name appears in the left pane of"
" the discussion forum for the course."
msgstr ""
"Jina la kategoria ndogo kwa mjadala. Jina hili linaonekana kwenye kidirisha "
"cha kushoto cha jukwaa la mijadala kwa kozi."

#: xmodule/discussion_block.py:185
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"You are not signed in. To view the discussion content, {sign_in_link} or "
"{register_link}, and enroll in this course."
msgstr ""
"Hujaingia. Ili kuona maudhui ya mjadala, {sign_in_link} au {register_link}, "
"kisha jiandikishe kwenye kozi hii."

#: xmodule/graders.py:274
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{assignment_type} = {weighted_percent:.2%} of a possible {weight:.2%}"
msgstr ""

#: xmodule/graders.py:380
msgid "Generated"
msgstr "Imetengenezwa"

#: xmodule/graders.py:401
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{section_type} {index} Unreleased - 0% (?/?)"
msgstr "{section_type} {index} Haijatolewa - 0% (?/?)"

#: xmodule/graders.py:415
#, python-brace-format
msgid "The lowest {drop_count} {section_type} scores are dropped."
msgstr "Alama za chini zaidi {drop_count} za {section_type} zinaondolewa."

#: xmodule/graders.py:434
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{section_type} Average = {percent:.2%}"
msgstr ""

#: xmodule/graders.py:439
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{short_label} Avg"
msgstr "Wastani wa {short_label}"

#: xmodule/hidden_block.py:38
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"ERROR: \"{block_type}\" is an unknown component type. This component will be"
" hidden in LMS."
msgstr ""
"HITILAFU: \"{block_type}\" ni aina ya kipengele isiyojulikana. Kipengele "
"hiki kitafichwa kwenye LMS."

#: xmodule/html_block.py:64 xmodule/html_block.py:404
#: xmodule/html_block.py:466
msgid "Html contents to display for this block"
msgstr "Maudhui ya HTML ya kuonyesha kwa blok hii"

#: xmodule/html_block.py:66
msgid "Upstream html contents to store upstream data field"
msgstr ""
"Maudhui ya HTML ya juu (upstream) ya kuhifadhi uga wa data wa juu (upstream)"

#: xmodule/html_block.py:73
msgid "Source code for LaTeX documents. This feature is not well-supported."
msgstr "Msimbo chanzo wa hati za LaTeX. Kipengele hiki hakina usaidizi mzuri."

#: xmodule/html_block.py:83
msgid ""
"Select Visual to enter content and have the editor automatically create the "
"HTML. Select Raw to edit HTML directly. If you change this setting, you must"
" save the component and then re-open it for editing."
msgstr ""
"Chagua Visual ili kuingiza maudhui na mhariri atengeneze HTML kiotomatiki. "
"Chagua Raw ili kuhariri HTML moja kwa moja. Ukibadilisha mpangilio huu, "
"lazima uhifadhi kipengele kisha ukifungue tena ili kuhariri."

#: xmodule/html_block.py:86
msgid "Editor"
msgstr "Mhariri"

#: xmodule/html_block.py:89
msgid "Visual"
msgstr "Visual"

#: xmodule/html_block.py:90
msgid "Raw"
msgstr "Raw"

#: xmodule/html_block.py:432
msgid "Hide Page From Learners"
msgstr "Ficha Ukurasa kwa Wanafunzi"

#: xmodule/html_block.py:433
msgid ""
"If you select this option, only course team members with the Staff or Admin "
"role see this page."
msgstr ""
"Ukichagua chaguo hili, ni wanatimu wa kozi wenye jukumu la Staff au Admin "
"pekee ndio wataona ukurasa huu."

#: xmodule/html_block.py:443
msgid "HTML for the additional pages"
msgstr "HTML ya kurasa za ziada"

#: xmodule/html_block.py:461
msgid "List of course update items"
msgstr "Orodha ya vipengee vya masasisho ya kozi"

#: xmodule/item_bank_block.py:68
msgid "Count"
msgstr "Idadi"

#: xmodule/item_bank_block.py:69
msgid ""
"Enter the number of components to display to each student. Set it to -1 to "
"display all components."
msgstr ""
"Weka idadi ya vipengele vya kuonyesha kwa kila mwanafunzi. Iweke -1 ili "
"kuonyesha vipengele vyote."

#: xmodule/item_bank_block.py:82
msgid ""
"Determines whether a 'Reset Problems' button is shown, so users may reset "
"their answers and reshuffle selected items."
msgstr ""
"Huamua kama kitufe cha 'Reset Problems' kitaonyeshwa, ili watumiaji waweze "
"kuweka upya majibu yao na kuchanganya upya vipengee vilivyochaguliwa."

#: xmodule/item_bank_block.py:480
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The problem bank has been configured to show {count} problems. Please "
"specify a positive number of problems, or specify -1 to show all problems."
msgstr ""
"Benki ya maswali imesanidiwa kuonyesha maswali {count}. Tafadhali bainisha "
"idadi chanya ya maswali, au bainisha -1 ili kuonyesha maswali yote."

#: xmodule/item_bank_block.py:484 xmodule/item_bank_block.py:496
msgid "Edit the problem bank configuration."
msgstr "Hariri usanidi wa benki ya maswali."

#: xmodule/item_bank_block.py:492
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The problem bank has been configured to show {count} problems, but only "
"{actual} have been selected."
msgstr ""
"Benki ya maswali imesanidiwa kuonyesha maswali {count}, lakini ni {actual} "
"pekee yaliyochaguliwa."

#: xmodule/library_content_block.py:57
msgid "Any Type"
msgstr "Aina Yoyote"

#: xmodule/library_content_block.py:89
msgid "Library"
msgstr "Maktaba"

#: xmodule/library_content_block.py:90
msgid "Select the library from which you want to draw content."
msgstr "Chagua maktaba unayotaka kuchota maudhui."

#: xmodule/library_content_block.py:96
msgid "Library Version"
msgstr "Toleo la Maktaba"

#: xmodule/library_content_block.py:100
msgid "Problem Type"
msgstr "Aina ya Swali"

#: xmodule/library_content_block.py:101
msgid ""
"Choose a problem type to fetch from the library. If \"Any Type\" is selected"
" no filtering is applied."
msgstr ""
"Chagua aina ya swali ya kuchota kutoka maktaba. Ikiwa \"Aina Yoyote\" "
"imechaguliwa hakuna uchujaji unaotumika."

#: xmodule/library_content_block.py:113
msgid "Is Migrated to library v2"
msgstr "Imehamishwa kwenda maktaba v2"

#: xmodule/library_content_block.py:242
msgid ""
"This block is already migrated to use library v2. You can sync individual "
"blocks now"
msgstr ""
"Blok hii tayari imehamishwa kutumia maktaba v2. Unaweza kusawazisha blok "
"binafsi sasa"

#: xmodule/library_content_block.py:247
msgid "Source content library has not been specified."
msgstr "Maktaba ya maudhui chanzo haijabainishwa."

#: xmodule/library_content_block.py:251
msgid "Content libraries are not available in the current runtime."
msgstr ""
"Maktaba za maudhui hazipatikani katika mazingira ya sasa ya uendeshaji."

#: xmodule/library_content_block.py:254
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Source content library does not exist: {source_library_id}"
msgstr "Maktaba ya maudhui chanzo haipo: {source_library_id}"

#: xmodule/library_content_block.py:358
msgid ""
"This legacy library reference is no longer supported, and needs to be "
"updated to receive future changes"
msgstr ""
"Rejea hii ya maktaba ya urithi haiungwa mkono tena, na inahitaji kusasishwa "
"ili kupokea mabadiliko yajayo"

#: xmodule/library_content_block.py:365
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{refresh_icon} Update reference"
msgstr "{refresh_icon} Sasisha rejea"

#: xmodule/library_content_block.py:374
msgid "This component is out of date. The library has new content."
msgstr "Kipengele hiki kimepitwa na wakati. Maktaba ina maudhui mapya."

#: xmodule/library_content_block.py:379
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{refresh_icon} Update now."
msgstr "{refresh_icon} Sasisha sasa."

#: xmodule/library_content_block.py:387
msgid "Library is invalid, corrupt, or has been deleted."
msgstr "Maktaba si halali, imeharibika, au imefutwa."

#: xmodule/library_content_block.py:389
msgid "Edit Library List."
msgstr "Hariri Orodha ya Maktaba."

#: xmodule/library_content_block.py:407
msgid "The source library has not been migrated to version 2"
msgstr "Maktaba chanzo haijahamishwa kwenda toleo la 2"

#: xmodule/library_content_block.py:409
msgid "The block has already been upgraded to version 2"
msgstr "Blok tayari imeboreshwa kwenda toleo la 2"

#: xmodule/library_content_block.py:436
msgid ""
"This course does not support content libraries. Contact your system "
"administrator for more information."
msgstr ""
"Kozi hii haiungi mkono maktaba za maudhui. Wasiliana na msimamizi wa mfumo "
"wako kwa maelezo zaidi."

#: xmodule/library_content_block.py:446
msgid "A library has not yet been selected."
msgstr "Bado hakuna maktaba iliyochaguliwa."

#: xmodule/library_content_block.py:448
msgid "Select a Library."
msgstr "Chagua Maktaba."

#: xmodule/library_content_block.py:467
#, python-brace-format
msgid "There are no problems in the specified library of type {capa_type}."
msgstr "Hakuna maswali katika maktaba iliyobainishwa ya aina {capa_type}."

#: xmodule/library_content_block.py:470
msgid "Select another problem type."
msgstr "Chagua aina nyingine ya swali."

#: xmodule/library_content_block.py:481
#, python-brace-format
msgid "The specified library is configured to fetch {count} problem, "
msgid_plural "The specified library is configured to fetch {count} problems, "
msgstr[0] "Maktaba iliyobainishwa imesanidiwa kuchota swali {count},"
msgstr[1] "Maktaba iliyobainishwa imesanidiwa kuchota maswali {count},"

#: xmodule/library_content_block.py:486
#, python-brace-format
msgid "but there is only {actual} matching problem."
msgid_plural "but there are only {actual} matching problems."
msgstr[0] "lakini kuna swali {actual} pekee linalolingana."
msgstr[1] "lakini kuna maswali {actual} pekee yanayolingana."

#: xmodule/library_content_block.py:492
msgid "Edit the library configuration."
msgstr "Hariri usanidi wa maktaba."

#: xmodule/library_content_block.py:510
msgid "Invalid Library"
msgstr "Maktaba Batili"

#: xmodule/library_content_block.py:511
msgid "No Library Selected"
msgstr "Hakuna Maktaba Iliyochaguliwa"

#: xmodule/library_root_xblock.py:32
msgid "Library Display Name"
msgstr "Jina la Kuonyesha la Maktaba"

#: xmodule/library_root_xblock.py:37
msgid "Enter the names of the advanced components to use in your library."
msgstr ""
"Weka majina ya vipengele vya hali ya juu vya kutumia katika maktaba yako."

#: xmodule/lti_block.py:133
msgid ""
"The display name for this component. Analytics reports may also use the "
"display name to identify this component."
msgstr ""
"Jina la kuonyesha la kipengele hiki. Ripoti za uchanganuzi zinaweza pia "
"kutumia jina la kuonyesha kutambua kipengele hiki."

#: xmodule/lti_block.py:140
msgid "LTI ID"
msgstr "Kitambulisho cha LTI"

#: xmodule/lti_block.py:142
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Enter the LTI ID for the external LTI provider.  This value must be the same"
" LTI ID that you entered in the LTI Passports setting on the Advanced "
"Settings page.{break_tag}See {docs_anchor_open}the edX LTI "
"documentation{anchor_close} for more details on this setting."
msgstr ""
"Weka kitambulisho cha LTI kwa mtoa huduma wa nje wa LTI. Thamani hii lazima "
"iwe sawa na kitambulisho cha LTI ulichoweka kwenye mpangilio wa LTI "
"Passports kwenye ukurasa wa Advanced Settings.{break_tag}Tazama "
"{docs_anchor_open}nyaraka za edX LTI{anchor_close} kwa maelezo zaidi kuhusu "
"mpangilio huu."

#: xmodule/lti_block.py:155
msgid "LTI URL"
msgstr "URL ya LTI"

#: xmodule/lti_block.py:157
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Enter the URL of the external tool that this component launches. This "
"setting is only used when Hide External Tool is set to False.{break_tag}See "
"{docs_anchor_open}the edX LTI documentation{anchor_close} for more details "
"on this setting."
msgstr ""
"Weka URL ya zana ya nje ambayo kipengele hiki huzindua. Mpangilio huu "
"hutumika tu wakati Hide External Tool imewekwa kuwa False.{break_tag}Tazama "
"{docs_anchor_open}nyaraka za edX LTI{anchor_close} kwa maelezo zaidi kuhusu "
"mpangilio huu."

#: xmodule/lti_block.py:168
msgid "Custom Parameters"
msgstr "Vigezo Maalum"

#: xmodule/lti_block.py:170
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Add the key/value pair for any custom parameters, such as the page your "
"e-book should open to or the background color for this "
"component.{break_tag}See {docs_anchor_open}the edX LTI "
"documentation{anchor_close} for more details on this setting."
msgstr ""
"Ongeza jozi ya ufunguo/thamani kwa vigezo vyovyote maalum, kama vile ukurasa"
" ambao e-book yako inapaswa kufunguka au rangi ya mandharinyuma ya kipengele"
" hiki.{break_tag}Tazama {docs_anchor_open}nyaraka za edX LTI{anchor_close} "
"kwa maelezo zaidi kuhusu mpangilio huu."

#: xmodule/lti_block.py:180
msgid "Open in New Page"
msgstr "Fungua katika Ukurasa Mpya"

#: xmodule/lti_block.py:182
msgid ""
"Select True if you want students to click a link that opens the LTI tool in "
"a new window. Select False if you want the LTI content to open in an IFrame "
"in the current page. This setting is only used when Hide External Tool is "
"set to False.  "
msgstr ""
"Chagua True ikiwa unataka wanafunzi wabofye kiungo kinachofungua zana ya LTI"
" kwenye dirisha jipya. Chagua False ikiwa unataka maudhui ya LTI yafunguke "
"kwenye IFrame katika ukurasa wa sasa. Mpangilio huu hutumika tu wakati Hide "
"External Tool imewekwa kuwa False."

#: xmodule/lti_block.py:190
msgid "Scored"
msgstr "Inapewa Alama"

#: xmodule/lti_block.py:192
msgid ""
"Select True if this component will receive a numerical score from the "
"external LTI system."
msgstr ""
"Chagua True ikiwa kipengele hiki kitapokea alama ya nambari kutoka mfumo wa "
"nje wa LTI."

#: xmodule/lti_block.py:198
msgid "Weight"
msgstr "Uzito"

#: xmodule/lti_block.py:200
msgid ""
"Enter the number of points possible for this component.  The default value "
"is 1.0.  This setting is only used when Scored is set to True."
msgstr ""
"Weka idadi ya pointi zinazowezekana kwa kipengele hiki. Thamani chaguomsingi"
" ni 1.0. Mpangilio huu hutumika tu wakati Scored imewekwa kuwa True."

#: xmodule/lti_block.py:209
msgid ""
"The score kept in the xblock KVS -- duplicate of the published score in "
"django DB"
msgstr ""
"Alama inayohifadhiwa kwenye xblock KVS -- nakala ya alama iliyochapishwa "
"kwenye django DB"

#: xmodule/lti_block.py:214
msgid "Comment as returned from grader, LTI2.0 spec"
msgstr "Maoni kama yalivyorejeshwa kutoka kwa mkadiriaji, LTI2.0 spec"

#: xmodule/lti_block.py:219
msgid "Hide External Tool"
msgstr "Ficha Zana ya Nje"

#: xmodule/lti_block.py:221
msgid ""
"Select True if you want to use this component as a placeholder for syncing "
"with an external grading  system rather than launch an external tool.  This "
"setting hides the Launch button and any IFrames for this component."
msgstr ""
"Chagua True ikiwa unataka kutumia kipengele hiki kama kishikilia nafasi kwa "
"ajili ya kusawazisha na mfumo wa nje wa utoaji alama badala ya kuzindua zana"
" ya nje. Mpangilio huu huficha kitufe cha Launch na IFrame zozote kwa "
"kipengele hiki."

#: xmodule/lti_block.py:232
msgid "Request user's username"
msgstr "Omba jina la mtumiaji"

#: xmodule/lti_block.py:234
msgid "Select True to request the user's username."
msgstr "Chagua True ili kuomba jina la mtumiaji."

#: xmodule/lti_block.py:239
msgid "Request user's email"
msgstr "Omba barua pepe ya mtumiaji"

#: xmodule/lti_block.py:241
msgid "Select True to request the user's email address."
msgstr "Chagua True ili kuomba anwani ya barua pepe ya mtumiaji."

#: xmodule/lti_block.py:247
msgid "LTI Application Information"
msgstr "Taarifa za Programu ya LTI"

#: xmodule/lti_block.py:249
msgid ""
"Enter a description of the third party application. If requesting username "
"and/or email, use this text box to inform users why their username and/or "
"email will be forwarded to a third party application."
msgstr ""
"Weka maelezo ya programu ya mtu wa tatu. Ikiwa unaomba jina la mtumiaji "
"na/au barua pepe, tumia kisanduku hiki cha maandishi kuwafahamisha watumiaji"
" kwa nini jina lao la mtumiaji na/au barua pepe itatumwa kwa programu ya mtu"
" wa tatu."

#: xmodule/lti_block.py:257
msgid "Button Text"
msgstr "Maandishi ya Kitufe"

#: xmodule/lti_block.py:259
msgid ""
"Enter the text on the button used to launch the third party application."
msgstr ""
"Weka maandishi kwenye kitufe kinachotumika kuzindua programu ya mtu wa tatu."

#: xmodule/lti_block.py:266
msgid "Accept grades past deadline"
msgstr "Kubali alama baada ya tarehe ya mwisho"

#: xmodule/lti_block.py:267
msgid ""
"Select True to allow third party systems to post grades past the deadline."
msgstr ""
"Chagua True ili kuruhusu mifumo ya mtu wa tatu kuchapisha alama baada ya "
"tarehe ya mwisho."

#: xmodule/lti_block.py:441
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Could not parse custom parameter: {custom_parameter}. Should be \"x=y\" "
"string."
msgstr ""
"Haikuweza kuchanganua kigezo maalum: {custom_parameter}. Kinapaswa kuwa "
"mfuatano \"x=y\"."

#: xmodule/lti_block.py:974
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Could not parse LTI passport: {lti_passport}. Should be \"id:key:secret\" "
"string."
msgstr ""
"Haikuweza kuchanganua pasipoti ya LTI: {lti_passport}. Inapaswa kuwa "
"mfuatano \"id:key:secret\"."

#: xmodule/modulestore/inheritance.py:46 xmodule/seq_block.py:76
msgid "Due Date"
msgstr "Tarehe ya Mwisho"

#: xmodule/modulestore/inheritance.py:47
msgid "Enter the default date by which problems are due."
msgstr ""
"Weka tarehe chaguomsingi ambayo maswali yanapaswa kukamilishwa kufikia."

#: xmodule/modulestore/inheritance.py:52 xmodule/seq_block.py:82
msgid "Number of Relative Weeks Due By"
msgstr "Idadi ya Wiki Husika za Mwisho"

#: xmodule/modulestore/inheritance.py:53 xmodule/seq_block.py:83
msgid ""
"Enter the number of weeks the problems are due by relative to the learner's "
"enrollment date"
msgstr ""
"Weka idadi ya wiki ambazo maswali yanapaswa kukamilishwa kufikia, "
"ikilinganishwa na tarehe ya mwanafunzi kujiandikisha"

#: xmodule/modulestore/inheritance.py:69
msgid "GIT URL"
msgstr "URL ya GIT"

#: xmodule/modulestore/inheritance.py:70
msgid "Enter the URL for the course data GIT repository."
msgstr "Weka URL ya hazina ya GIT ya data ya kozi."

#: xmodule/modulestore/inheritance.py:74
msgid "XQA Key"
msgstr "Ufunguo wa XQA"

#: xmodule/modulestore/inheritance.py:75
msgid "This setting is not currently supported."
msgstr "Mpangilio huu hauungi mkono kwa sasa."

#: xmodule/modulestore/inheritance.py:83
msgid "Enter the ids for the content groups this problem belongs to."
msgstr ""
"Weka vitambulisho vya vikundi vya maudhui ambavyo swali hili ni sehemu yake."

#: xmodule/modulestore/inheritance.py:92
msgid ""
"Specify when the Show Answer button appears for each problem. Valid values "
"are \"always\", \"answered\", \"attempted\", \"closed\", \"finished\", "
"\"past_due\", \"correct_or_past_due\", \"after_all_attempts\", "
"\"after_all_attempts_or_correct\", \"attempted_no_past_due\", and \"never\"."
msgstr ""
"Bainisha ni lini kitufe cha Show Answer kinaonekana kwa kila swali. Thamani "
"halali ni \"always\", \"answered\", \"attempted\", \"closed\", \"finished\","
" \"past_due\", \"correct_or_past_due\", \"after_all_attempts\", "
"\"after_all_attempts_or_correct\", \"attempted_no_past_due\", na \"never\"."

#: xmodule/modulestore/inheritance.py:106
msgid ""
"Specify when to show answer correctness and score to learners. Valid values "
"are \"always\", \"never\", and \"past_due\"."
msgstr ""
"Bainisha ni lini kuonyesha usahihi wa jibu na alama kwa wanafunzi. Thamani "
"halali ni \"always\", \"never\", na \"past_due\"."

#: xmodule/modulestore/inheritance.py:118
msgid ""
"Specify the default for how often variable values in a problem are "
"randomized. This setting should be set to \"never\" unless you plan to "
"provide a Python script to identify and randomize values in most of the "
"problems in your course. Valid values are \"always\", \"onreset\", "
"\"never\", and \"per_student\"."
msgstr ""
"Bainisha chaguomsingi ya mara ngapi thamani za vigeu katika swali "
"huchanganywa nasibu. Mpangilio huu unapaswa kuwekwa kuwa \"never\" isipokuwa"
" unapanga kutoa hati ya Python ya kutambua na kuchanganya thamani katika "
"maswali mengi ya kozi yako. Thamani halali ni \"always\", \"onreset\", "
"\"never\", na \"per_student\"."

#: xmodule/modulestore/inheritance.py:127
msgid "Days Early for Beta Users"
msgstr "Siku za Mapema kwa Watumiaji wa Beta"

#: xmodule/modulestore/inheritance.py:128
msgid ""
"Enter the number of days before the start date that beta users can access "
"the course."
msgstr ""
"Weka idadi ya siku kabla ya tarehe ya kuanza ambazo watumiaji wa beta "
"wanaweza kufikia kozi."

#: xmodule/modulestore/inheritance.py:133
msgid "Static Asset Path"
msgstr "Njia ya Rasilimali Tuli"

#: xmodule/modulestore/inheritance.py:134
msgid ""
"Enter the path to use for files on the Files & Uploads page. This value "
"overrides the Studio default, c4x://."
msgstr ""
"Weka njia ya kutumia kwa faili kwenye ukurasa wa Files & Uploads. Thamani "
"hii hubatilisha chaguomsingi cha Studio, c4x://."

#: xmodule/modulestore/inheritance.py:139
msgid "Enable LaTeX Compiler"
msgstr "Wezesha Kikompaili cha LaTeX"

#: xmodule/modulestore/inheritance.py:140
msgid ""
"Enter true or false. If true, you can use the LaTeX templates for HTML "
"components and advanced Problem components."
msgstr ""
"Weka true au false. Ikiwa true, unaweza kutumia violezo vya LaTeX kwa "
"vipengele vya HTML na vipengele vya hali ya juu vya Problem."

#: xmodule/modulestore/inheritance.py:146
msgid ""
"Enter the maximum number of times a student can try to answer problems. By "
"default, Maximum Attempts is set to null, meaning that students have an "
"unlimited number of attempts for problems. You can override this course-wide"
" setting for individual problems. However, if the course-wide setting is a "
"specific number, you cannot set the Maximum Attempts for individual problems"
" to unlimited."
msgstr ""
"Weka idadi ya juu zaidi ya mara ambazo mwanafunzi anaweza kujaribu kujibu "
"maswali. Kwa chaguomsingi, Maximum Attempts huwekwa kuwa null, ikimaanisha "
"kuwa wanafunzi wana idadi isiyo na kikomo ya majaribio kwa maswali. Unaweza "
"kubatilisha mpangilio huu wa kozi nzima kwa maswali binafsi. Hata hivyo, "
"ikiwa mpangilio wa kozi nzima ni nambari maalum, huwezi kuweka Maximum "
"Attempts kwa maswali binafsi kuwa isiyo na kikomo."

#: xmodule/modulestore/inheritance.py:151
msgid ""
"Enter the API key provided by MathWorks for accessing the MATLAB Hosted "
"Service. This key is granted for exclusive use in this course for the "
"specified duration. Do not share the API key with other courses. Notify "
"MathWorks immediately if you believe the key is exposed or compromised. To "
"obtain a key for your course, or to report an issue, please contact "
"moocsupport@mathworks.com"
msgstr ""
"Weka ufunguo wa API uliotolewa na MathWorks kwa ajili ya kufikia MATLAB "
"Hosted Service. Ufunguo huu umetolewa kwa matumizi ya kipekee katika kozi "
"hii kwa muda uliobainishwa. Usishiriki ufunguo wa API na kozi nyingine. "
"Mjulishe MathWorks mara moja ikiwa unaamini ufunguo umefichuliwa au "
"umeathiriwa. Ili kupata ufunguo kwa kozi yako, au kuripoti tatizo, tafadhali"
" wasiliana na moocsupport@mathworks.com"

#: xmodule/modulestore/inheritance.py:161
msgid "Group Configurations"
msgstr "Usanidi wa Vikundi"

#: xmodule/modulestore/inheritance.py:162
msgid ""
"Enter the configurations that govern how students are grouped together."
msgstr "Weka usanidi unaoongoza jinsi wanafunzi wanavyopangwa pamoja."

#: xmodule/modulestore/inheritance.py:167
msgid "Enable video caching system"
msgstr "Wezesha mfumo wa kuhifadhi video kwenye kashe"

#: xmodule/modulestore/inheritance.py:168
msgid ""
"Enter true or false. If true, video caching will be used for HTML5 videos."
msgstr ""
"Weka true au false. Ikiwa true, kuhifadhi video kwenye kashe kutatumika kwa "
"video za HTML5."

#: xmodule/modulestore/inheritance.py:173
msgid "Enable video auto-advance"
msgstr "Wezesha kusonga mbele kiotomatiki kwa video"

#: xmodule/modulestore/inheritance.py:175
msgid ""
"Specify whether to show an auto-advance button in videos. If the student "
"clicks it, when the last video in a unit finishes it will automatically move"
" to the next unit and autoplay the first video."
msgstr ""
"Bainisha kama kuonyesha kitufe cha kusonga mbele kiotomatiki kwenye video. "
"Mwanafunzi akibofya, video ya mwisho katika kitengo inapomalizika itahamia "
"kiotomatiki kwenye kitengo kinachofuata na kuanza kucheza video ya kwanza."

#: xmodule/modulestore/inheritance.py:181
msgid "Video Pre-Roll"
msgstr "Video ya Utangulizi (Pre-Roll)"

#: xmodule/modulestore/inheritance.py:183
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Identify a video, 5-10 seconds in length, to play before course videos. "
"Enter the video ID from the Video Uploads page and one or more transcript "
"files in the following format: {format}. For example, an entry for a video "
"with two transcripts looks like this: {example}"
msgstr ""
"Tambua video yenye urefu wa sekunde 5-10 ya kuchezwa kabla ya video za kozi."
" Weka kitambulisho cha video kutoka ukurasa wa Video Uploads na faili moja "
"au zaidi za manukuu katika muundo ufuatao: {format}. Kwa mfano, ingizo la "
"video yenye manukuu mawili linaonekana hivi: {example}"

#: xmodule/modulestore/inheritance.py:200
msgid "Show Reset Button for Problems"
msgstr "Onyesha Kitufe cha Reset kwa Maswali"

#: xmodule/modulestore/inheritance.py:202
msgid ""
"Enter true or false. If true, problems in the course default to always "
"displaying a 'Reset' button. You can override this in each problem's "
"settings. All existing problems are affected when this course-wide setting "
"is changed."
msgstr ""
"Weka true au false. Ikiwa true, maswali katika kozi kwa chaguomsingi "
"yataonyesha kila wakati kitufe cha 'Reset'. Unaweza kubatilisha hili katika "
"mipangilio ya kila swali. Maswali yote yaliyopo yataathiriwa mpangilio huu "
"wa kozi nzima unapobadilishwa."

#: xmodule/modulestore/inheritance.py:210
msgid "Enable Student Notes"
msgstr "Wezesha Student Notes"

#: xmodule/modulestore/inheritance.py:211
msgid ""
"Enter true or false. If true, students can use the Student Notes feature."
msgstr ""
"Weka true au false. Ikiwa true, wanafunzi wanaweza kutumia kipengele cha "
"Student Notes."

#: xmodule/modulestore/inheritance.py:217
msgid ""
"Indicates whether Student Notes are visible in the course. Students can also"
" show or hide their notes in the courseware."
msgstr ""
"Huonyesha kama Student Notes zinaonekana katika kozi. Wanafunzi pia wanaweza"
" kuonyesha au kuficha madokezo yao katika kozi."

#: xmodule/modulestore/inheritance.py:224
msgid "Tag this block as part of an Entrance Exam section"
msgstr "Weka lebo kwenye blok hii kama sehemu ya sehemu ya Entrance Exam"

#: xmodule/modulestore/inheritance.py:225
msgid ""
"Enter true or false. If true, answer submissions for problem blocks will be "
"considered in the Entrance Exam scoring/gating algorithm."
msgstr ""
"Weka true au false. Ikiwa true, uwasilishaji wa majibu kwa blok za maswali "
"utazingatiwa katika algoriti ya utoaji alama/udhibiti wa Entrance Exam."

#: xmodule/modulestore/inheritance.py:243
msgid "Hide from Table of Contents"
msgstr "Ficha kutoka Jedwali la Yaliyomo"

#: xmodule/modulestore/inheritance.py:244
msgid ""
"Enter true or false. If true, this block will be hidden from the Table of "
"Contents."
msgstr ""
"Weka true au false. Ikiwa true, blok hii itafichwa kutoka Jedwali la "
"Yaliyomo."

#: xmodule/modulestore/xml_importer.py:82
msgid "Error while reading {}. Check file for XML errors."
msgstr "Hitilafu wakati wa kusoma {}. Kagua faili kwa makosa ya XML."

#: xmodule/modulestore/xml_importer.py:94
msgid "Failed to import block: {} at location: {}"
msgstr "Imeshindwa kuingiza blok: {} katika eneo: {}"

#: xmodule/partitions/enrollment_track_partition_generator.py:38
msgid "Enrollment Track Groups"
msgstr "Vikundi vya Njia ya Uandikishaji"

#: xmodule/partitions/enrollment_track_partition_generator.py:39
msgid "Partition for segmenting users by enrollment track"
msgstr "Mgawanyo wa kugawa watumiaji kwa njia ya uandikishaji"

#: xmodule/poll_block.py:57
msgid "Whether this student has voted on the poll"
msgstr "Ikiwa mwanafunzi huyu amepiga kura kwenye kura ya maoni"

#: xmodule/poll_block.py:62
msgid "Student answer"
msgstr "Jibu la mwanafunzi"

#: xmodule/poll_block.py:67
msgid "Poll answers from all students"
msgstr "Majibu ya kura ya maoni kutoka kwa wanafunzi wote"

#: xmodule/poll_block.py:73
msgid "Poll answers from xml"
msgstr "Majibu ya kura ya maoni kutoka xml"

#: xmodule/poll_block.py:79
msgid "Poll question"
msgstr "Swali la kura ya maoni"

#: xmodule/seq_block.py:77
msgid "Enter the date by which problems are due."
msgstr "Weka tarehe ambayo maswali yanapaswa kukamilishwa kufikia."

#: xmodule/seq_block.py:88
msgid "Hide sequence content After Due Date"
msgstr "Ficha maudhui ya mfuatano Baada ya Tarehe ya Mwisho"

#: xmodule/seq_block.py:90
msgid ""
"If set, the sequence content is hidden for non-staff users after the due "
"date has passed."
msgstr ""
"Ikiwekwa, maudhui ya mfuatano hufichwa kwa watumiaji wasio wafanyakazi baada"
" ya tarehe ya mwisho kupita."

#: xmodule/seq_block.py:97
msgid "Is Entrance Exam"
msgstr "Ni Entrance Exam"

#: xmodule/seq_block.py:99
msgid ""
"Tag this course block as an Entrance Exam. Note, you must enable Entrance "
"Exams for this course setting to take effect."
msgstr ""
"Weka lebo kwenye blok hii ya kozi kama Entrance Exam. Kumbuka, lazima "
"uwezeshe Entrance Exams kwa kozi hii ili mpangilio huu uanze kufanya kazi."

#: xmodule/seq_block.py:150
msgid "Is Time Limited"
msgstr "Ina Kikomo cha Muda"

#: xmodule/seq_block.py:152
msgid ""
"This setting indicates whether students have a limited time to view or "
"interact with this courseware component."
msgstr ""
"Mpangilio huu unaonyesha kama wanafunzi wana muda mdogo wa kuona au "
"kuingiliana na kipengele hiki cha kozi."

#: xmodule/seq_block.py:160
msgid "Time Limit in Minutes"
msgstr "Kikomo cha Muda kwa Dakika"

#: xmodule/seq_block.py:162
msgid ""
"The number of minutes available to students for viewing or interacting with "
"this courseware component."
msgstr ""
"Idadi ya dakika zinazopatikana kwa wanafunzi kwa ajili ya kuona au "
"kuingiliana na kipengele hiki cha kozi."

#: xmodule/seq_block.py:169
msgid "Is Proctoring Enabled"
msgstr "Uangalizi (Proctoring) Umewezeshwa"

#: xmodule/seq_block.py:171
msgid "This setting indicates whether this exam is a proctored exam."
msgstr ""
"Mpangilio huu unaonyesha kama mtihani huu ni mtihani unaosimamiwa "
"(proctored)."

#: xmodule/seq_block.py:178
msgid "Software Secure Review Rules"
msgstr "Sheria za Mapitio ya Software Secure"

#: xmodule/seq_block.py:180
msgid ""
"This setting indicates what rules the proctoring team should follow when "
"viewing the videos."
msgstr ""
"Mpangilio huu unaonyesha ni sheria zipi timu ya uangalizi inapaswa kufuata "
"inapokagua video."

#: xmodule/seq_block.py:187
msgid "Is Practice Exam"
msgstr "Ni Mtihani wa Mazoezi"

#: xmodule/seq_block.py:189
msgid ""
"This setting indicates whether this exam is for testing purposes only. "
"Practice exams are not verified."
msgstr ""
"Mpangilio huu unaonyesha kama mtihani huu ni kwa madhumuni ya majaribio tu. "
"Mitihani ya mazoezi haithibitishwi."

#: xmodule/seq_block.py:196
msgid "Is Onboarding Exam"
msgstr "Ni Mtihani wa Onboarding"

#: xmodule/seq_block.py:198
msgid "This setting indicates whether this exam is an onboarding exam."
msgstr "Mpangilio huu unaonyesha kama mtihani huu ni mtihani wa onboarding."

#: xmodule/seq_block.py:356 xmodule/seq_block.py:448
msgid ""
"This subsection is unlocked for learners when they meet the prerequisite "
"requirements."
msgstr ""
"Kifungu hiki kidogo hufunguliwa kwa wanafunzi wanapotimiza mahitaji ya "
"awali."

#: xmodule/seq_block.py:500
msgid "This exam is hidden from the learner."
msgstr "Mtihani huu umefichwa kutoka kwa mwanafunzi."

#: xmodule/seq_block.py:509
msgid ""
"Because the course has ended, this assignment is hidden from the learner."
msgstr "Kwa sababu kozi imekwisha, kazi hii imefichwa kutoka kwa mwanafunzi."

#: xmodule/seq_block.py:511
msgid ""
"Because the due date has passed, this assignment is hidden from the learner."
msgstr ""
"Kwa sababu tarehe ya mwisho imepita, kazi hii imefichwa kutoka kwa "
"mwanafunzi."

#: xmodule/seq_block.py:555
msgid ""
"This section is a prerequisite. You must complete this section in order to "
"unlock additional content."
msgstr ""
"Sehemu hii ni sharti la awali. Lazima ukamilishe sehemu hii ili kufungua "
"maudhui ya ziada."

#: xmodule/seq_block.py:994
msgid ""
"A list summarizing what students should look forward to in this section."
msgstr ""
"Orodha inayofupisha kile wanafunzi wanapaswa kutarajia katika sehemu hii."

#: xmodule/split_test_block.py:42
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Group ID {group_id}"
msgstr "Kitambulisho cha Kikundi {group_id}"

#: xmodule/split_test_block.py:79
msgid "Not Selected"
msgstr "Haijachaguliwa"

#: xmodule/split_test_block.py:83
msgid "The display name for this component. (Not shown to learners)"
msgstr "Jina la kuonyesha la kipengele hiki. (Halionyeshwi kwa wanafunzi)"

#: xmodule/split_test_block.py:85
msgid "Content Experiment"
msgstr "Jaribio la Maudhui"

#: xmodule/split_test_block.py:96
msgid ""
"The configuration defines how users are grouped for this content experiment."
" Caution: Changing the group configuration of a student-visible experiment "
"will impact the experiment data."
msgstr ""
"Usanidi hufafanua jinsi watumiaji wanavyopangwa kwa jaribio hili la maudhui."
" Tahadhari: Kubadilisha usanidi wa kikundi wa jaribio linaloonekana kwa "
