"Time you want the video to stop if you don't want the entire video to play. "
"Not supported in the native mobile app: the full video file will play. "
"Formatted as HH:MM:SS. The maximum value is 23:59:59."
msgstr ""
"Muda unaotaka video isimame ikiwa hutaki video yote ichezwe. Haitumiki "
"kwenye programu asili ya simu: faili kamili ya video itachezwa. Imeundwa "
"kama HH:MM:SS. Thamani ya juu ni 23:59:59."

#: xmodule/video_block/video_xfields.py:71
msgid "Video Stop Time"
msgstr "Muda wa Kusimamisha Video"

#: xmodule/video_block/video_xfields.py:78
msgid ""
"Allow students to download versions of this video in different formats if "
"they cannot use the edX video player or do not have access to YouTube. You "
"must add at least one non-YouTube URL in the Video File URLs field."
msgstr ""
"Ruhusu wanafunzi kupakua matoleo ya video hii katika miundo tofauti ikiwa "
"hawawezi kutumia kicheza video cha edX au hawana ufikiaji wa YouTube. Lazima"
" uongeze angalau URL moja isiyo ya YouTube kwenye sehemu ya Video File URLs."

#: xmodule/video_block/video_xfields.py:81
msgid "Video Download Allowed"
msgstr "Upakuaji wa Video Umeruhusiwa"

#: xmodule/video_block/video_xfields.py:86
msgid ""
"The URL or URLs where you've posted non-YouTube versions of the video. Each "
"URL must end in .mpeg, .mp4, .ogg, or .webm and cannot be a YouTube URL. "
"(For browser compatibility, we strongly recommend .mp4 and .webm format.) "
"Students will be able to view the first listed video that's compatible with "
"the student's computer. To allow students to download these videos, set "
"Video Download Allowed to True."
msgstr ""
"URL au URL ulizochapisha matoleo yasiyo ya YouTube ya video. Kila URL lazima"
" iishe na .mpeg, .mp4, .ogg, au .webm na haiwezi kuwa URL ya YouTube. (Kwa "
"ulinganifu wa vivinjari, tunapendekeza sana muundo wa .mp4 na .webm.) "
"Wanafunzi wataweza kutazama video ya kwanza iliyo kwenye orodha inayolingana"
" na kompyuta ya mwanafunzi. Ili kuruhusu wanafunzi kupakua video hizi, weka "
"Video Download Allowed kuwa True."

#: xmodule/video_block/video_xfields.py:91
msgid "Video File URLs"
msgstr "URL za Faili za Video"

#: xmodule/video_block/video_xfields.py:95
msgid ""
"By default, students can download an .srt or .txt transcript when you set "
"Download Transcript Allowed to True. If you want to provide a downloadable "
"transcript in a different format, we recommend that you upload a handout by "
"using the Upload a Handout field. If this isn't possible, you can post a "
"transcript file on the Files & Uploads page or on the Internet, and then add"
" the URL for the transcript here. Students see a link to download that "
"transcript below the video."
msgstr ""
"Kwa chaguo-msingi, wanafunzi wanaweza kupakua nakala ya manukuu ya .srt au "
".txt unapoweka Download Transcript Allowed kuwa True. Ikiwa unataka kutoa "
"manukuu yanayopakuliwa katika muundo tofauti, tunapendekeza upakie handout "
"kwa kutumia sehemu ya Upload a Handout. Ikiwa hili haliwezekani, unaweza "
"kuchapisha faili ya manukuu kwenye ukurasa wa Files & Uploads au kwenye "
"Mtandao, kisha uongeze URL ya manukuu hapa. Wanafunzi huona kiungo cha "
"kupakua manukuu hayo chini ya video."

#: xmodule/video_block/video_xfields.py:100
msgid "Downloadable Transcript URL"
msgstr "URL ya Manukuu Yanayopakuliwa"

#: xmodule/video_block/video_xfields.py:105
msgid ""
"Allow students to download the timed transcript. A link to download the file"
" appears below the video. By default, the transcript is an .srt or .txt "
"file. If you want to provide the transcript for download in a different "
"format, upload a file by using the Upload Handout field."
msgstr ""
"Ruhusu wanafunzi kupakua manukuu yenye muda. Kiungo cha kupakua faili "
"huonekana chini ya video. Kwa chaguo-msingi, manukuu ni faili ya .srt au "
".txt. Ikiwa unataka kutoa manukuu ya kupakua katika muundo tofauti, pakia "
"faili kwa kutumia sehemu ya Upload Handout."

#: xmodule/video_block/video_xfields.py:108
msgid "Download Transcript Allowed"
msgstr "Upakuaji wa Manukuu Umeruhusiwa"

#: xmodule/video_block/video_xfields.py:115
msgid ""
"The default transcript for the video, from the Default Timed Transcript "
"field on the Basic tab. This transcript should be in English. You don't have"
" to change this setting."
msgstr ""
"Manukuu chaguo-msingi ya video, kutoka sehemu ya Default Timed Transcript "
"kwenye kichupo cha Basic. Manukuu haya yanapaswa kuwa kwa Kiingereza. "
"Huhitaji kubadilisha mpangilio huu."

#: xmodule/video_block/video_xfields.py:117
msgid "Default Timed Transcript"
msgstr "Manukuu Chaguo-msingi Yenye Muda"

#: xmodule/video_block/video_xfields.py:122
msgid "Specify whether the transcripts appear with the video by default."
msgstr "Bainisha ikiwa manukuu yanaonekana pamoja na video kwa chaguo-msingi."

